WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.018
Bin packing, unbounded gaps.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.692
The standard estimate was believed to be

3
00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:06.313
off by at most one bin.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.238
Graphs become items whose packings reveal vertex covers, with a built-in gap.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.640
Claimed: the gap can be any size.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.514
Lean checks the theorem.
